sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Courier
    participant LS as Logistics Service
    participant ENG as CODConfirmationEngine
    participant REP as DeliveryRepository
    actor B as Buyer

    C->>LS: POST /cod/:id/otp
    LS->>REP: findById(deliveryId)
    REP-->>LS: delivery(isCOD: true)
    LS->>ENG: generateOTP()
    ENG-->>LS: { otp, hashedOtp, expiresAt }
    LS->>REP: Save delivery (otp, expiresAt)
    LS->>B: Send SMS/Push (OTP)
    LS-->>C: 200 OK (Initiated)

    Note over C, B: Courier arrives at location

    C->>LS: POST /cod/:id/verify { otp, location }
    LS->>REP: findById(deliveryId)
    
    LS->>ENG: isWithinProximity(current, target)
    ENG-->>LS: boolean
    
    LS->>ENG: validateOTP(provided, stored)
    ENG-->>LS: boolean

    alt Valid OTP & Proximity
        LS->>REP: Update delivery (codVerified: true, collected: true)
        LS->>LS: complete_cod_delivery step
        LS->>LS: Emit COD_DELIVERY_CONFIRMED
        LS-->>C: 200 OK (Success)
    else Invalid
        LS-->>C: 400 Bad Request (Error Details)
    end
